@anon.6aa2d360734573fdde4b4ffe4a284ba1.1875 = private unnamed_addr constant [288 x i8] c"## What it does\0ACheck for multiple imports on one line.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AAccording to [PEP 8], \22imports should usually be on separate lines.\22\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Aimport sys, os\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Aimport os\0Aimport sys\0A```\0A\0A[PEP 8]: https://peps.python.org/pep-0008/#imports\0A", align 1
